---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const CONTACT_EMAIL = 'hello@firstandlastpickleball.co.uk';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How firstandlastpickleball.co.uk handles your data — analytics, cookies, and the third parties we use.">
  <section>
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">The boring but important bit</p>
      <h1>Privacy.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This is a small website for a pickleball club. It collects almost nothing about you. Here's
        exactly what happens when you visit.
      </p>

      <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
      <p>
        firstandlastpickleball.co.uk is the website of First &amp; Last Pickleball Club, St Just. It's
        a simple informational site — there are no accounts, no logins, and no forms that store your
        details. For any privacy question, email
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What data the site holds about you</h2>
      <p>
        Browsing these pages doesn't require you to enter anything, and we don't ask you to. Two
        things are worth being explicit about:
      </p>

      <h3>1. Privacy-friendly analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We use <a href="https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vercel
        Web Analytics</a>, a privacy-focused tool that <strong>does not use cookies</strong>, does not
        track you across other websites, and does not collect any personally identifiable information.
        It records aggregate page views and referring domains so we know which parts of the site are
        useful — that's it. There's no advertising on this site and we don't sell or share any data.
      </p>

      <h3>2. When you click through to Spond or email us</h3>
      <p>
        Joining the club happens on <a href="https://spond.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spond</a>,
        a separate service with its own privacy policy — anything you enter there is governed by
        Spond, not this site. Likewise, if you email us, we'll hold your message (and your email
        address) only for as long as we need to reply and deal with it.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies in use</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>None.</strong> This site sets no cookies — not for analytics, not for anything. There's
        no cookie banner because there's nothing to consent to.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>The site relies on these providers to function:</p>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>
          <strong>Vercel</strong> — hosting and analytics. To serve a page, Vercel processes the
          minimum necessary request data (your IP address, browser type and the URL requested).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Fonts</strong> — the site's typefaces are loaded from Google's font service,
          which receives your IP address as part of serving the font files.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Spond</strong> — only if you follow a link to join the club. Spond has its own
          privacy policy that applies once you're on their site or app.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your rights under UK GDPR</h2>
      <p>Because the site stores virtually nothing about you, these are simple to exercise:</p>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li><strong>Access &amp; erasure:</strong> there's no account or server-side profile to access or delete. Aggregate analytics data is not personally identifiable. For anything held in our email, contact us below.</li>
        <li><strong>Complain:</strong> you can complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office (<a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>) at any time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about any of this? Email
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and we'll do our best to help.
      </p>

      <p class="footer-note">Last updated: June 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 46rem; }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  h2:first-of-type { border-top: none; padding-top: 0; }
  h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .bullets {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .bullets li {
    padding: 0.55rem 0 0.55rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
  }
  .bullets li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .bullets li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1.05rem;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--coral);
  }
  .footer-note {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--sea-light);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
